1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:02,369
[wind gusting]

2
00:00:09,876 --> 00:00:10,810
[disguised robotic voice]
I got a message

3
00:00:10,810 --> 00:00:12,712
to meet someone here.

4
00:00:14,580 --> 00:00:16,049
Were you followed?

5
00:00:16,049 --> 00:00:18,551
[chuckles] If you thought
I could be followed,

6
00:00:18,551 --> 00:00:20,553
you wouldn't have sent
a message to me

7
00:00:20,553 --> 00:00:21,688
in the first place.

8
00:00:21,688 --> 00:00:23,856
Huh. True.

9
00:00:23,856 --> 00:00:25,625
So, what do you need me for?

10
00:00:25,625 --> 00:00:26,793
Revenge.

11
00:00:28,294 --> 00:00:30,629
I want you
to bring someone to me.

12
00:00:30,629 --> 00:00:32,098
Interesting,

13
00:00:32,098 --> 00:00:33,433
but let's be clear.

14
00:00:33,433 --> 00:00:34,767
Delivering people

15
00:00:34,767 --> 00:00:36,035
is a lot more expensive

16
00:00:36,035 --> 00:00:38,037
than delivering things.

17
00:00:38,037 --> 00:00:39,773
You got that kind of cash?

18
00:00:39,773 --> 00:00:41,641
Don't let my appearance
fool you.

19
00:00:41,641 --> 00:00:43,710
I am not without resources.

20
00:00:46,879 --> 00:00:48,314
Who's the target?

21
00:00:58,224 --> 00:01:01,361
I'll pay you five times
your regular fee.

22
00:01:01,361 --> 00:01:02,294
Hmm.

23
00:01:02,294 --> 00:01:04,730
This target must be important.

24
00:01:04,730 --> 00:01:08,701
Long ago, he and my sister
betrayed my family,

25
00:01:08,701 --> 00:01:11,036
but that is not your business.

26
00:01:11,036 --> 00:01:12,238
Do we have a deal?

27
00:01:13,907 --> 00:01:15,375
[wind gusting]

28
00:01:20,013 --> 00:01:22,248
[♪♪♪]

29
00:01:23,750 --> 00:01:25,217
Sir, Arrakore,

30
00:01:25,217 --> 00:01:27,219
if you would please, sir,

31
00:01:27,219 --> 00:01:29,889
could you heal my flower?

32
00:01:29,889 --> 00:01:32,191
I've tried everything!

33
00:01:32,191 --> 00:01:35,728
Is that a question or a wish?

34
00:01:35,728 --> 00:01:37,163
A wish! Right.

35
00:01:37,163 --> 00:01:38,163
[clearing throat]

36
00:01:38,163 --> 00:01:41,934
I wish my flower was blooming!

37
00:01:41,934 --> 00:01:45,305
Your wish is yours to keep.

38
00:01:47,774 --> 00:01:51,344
[stone rumbling]

39
00:01:51,344 --> 00:01:52,712
[gasping in delight]

40
00:01:52,712 --> 00:01:54,113
You're back to looking

41
00:01:54,113 --> 00:01:58,117
like your usual
beautiful self, Veronica.

42
00:01:58,117 --> 00:02:01,187
Your wish is yours to keep!

43
00:02:01,187 --> 00:02:02,789
[stone rumbling]

44
00:02:08,528 --> 00:02:11,364
I wish to become
a real Spinjitzu Ninja,

45
00:02:11,364 --> 00:02:14,066
like, for permanent.

46
00:02:14,066 --> 00:02:15,735
[sighing]

47
00:02:15,735 --> 00:02:18,071
Uh-uh.

48
00:02:18,071 --> 00:02:19,239
[♪♪♪]

49
00:02:24,777 --> 00:02:26,612
Seriously?

50
00:02:26,612 --> 00:02:27,513
What gives?

51
00:02:27,513 --> 00:02:30,883
I am never obligated
to grant a wish.

52
00:02:30,883 --> 00:02:33,052
Yeah, yeah, yeah, but...

53
00:02:33,052 --> 00:02:34,686
Pretty please?

54
00:02:34,686 --> 00:02:36,889
Mm... no.

55
00:02:36,889 --> 00:02:39,458
I can refuse for any reason.

56
00:02:39,458 --> 00:02:42,361
Sometimes it's beyond
the limits of my power,

57
00:02:42,361 --> 00:02:45,865
and sometimes I just don't think
it's a good idea.

58
00:02:45,865 --> 00:02:47,533
Which one is it this time?

59
00:02:47,533 --> 00:02:48,568
Both.

60
00:02:48,568 --> 00:02:50,302
Definitely both.

61
00:02:50,302 --> 00:02:53,139
[thunderclaps booming]

62
00:02:53,139 --> 00:02:54,106
Huh?

63
00:02:54,106 --> 00:02:55,341
What the crackle?

64
00:02:57,377 --> 00:03:01,247
This cannot be good.

65
00:03:02,849 --> 00:03:06,052
♪ Lost in the unknown ♪

66
00:03:06,052 --> 00:03:08,955
♪ Together we will rise ♪

67
00:03:08,955 --> 00:03:12,425
♪ We fight ♪

68
00:03:12,425 --> 00:03:15,528
♪ Be a ninja
for what's right ♪

69
00:03:16,696 --> 00:03:17,764
[thunderclaps]

70
00:03:17,764 --> 00:03:19,365
[♪♪♪]

71
00:03:21,601 --> 00:03:22,936
[panting in fear]

72
00:03:22,936 --> 00:03:25,938
I wish to be safe in bed
right now!

73
00:03:25,938 --> 00:03:27,072
[panting]

74
00:03:27,072 --> 00:03:28,474
Still no?

75
00:03:28,474 --> 00:03:30,276
Come on! Can't you hear me?

76
00:03:35,381 --> 00:03:38,217
And who might you be?

77
00:03:38,217 --> 00:03:39,852
I am Rox.

78
00:03:39,852 --> 00:03:42,121
Of the Forbidden Five.

79
00:03:42,121 --> 00:03:43,656
Never heard of you.

80
00:03:43,656 --> 00:03:45,257
Do not worry.

81
00:03:45,257 --> 00:03:47,927
Soon the entire world will cower

82
00:03:47,927 --> 00:03:50,462
at the sound of my name,

83
00:03:50,462 --> 00:03:52,498
but that's not why I'm here.

84
00:03:52,498 --> 00:03:55,768
You will repair this blade.

85
00:03:55,768 --> 00:03:58,004
[scoffing] You wish.

86
00:03:58,004 --> 00:04:00,272
I know exactly
what this blade is,

87
00:04:00,272 --> 00:04:03,343
and what evil
it can be used for.

88
00:04:03,343 --> 00:04:06,646
Does anyone have any clue
what this thing can be used for?

89
00:04:11,784 --> 00:04:13,753
[wind gusting]

90
00:04:13,753 --> 00:04:16,356
[♪♪♪]

91
00:04:17,623 --> 00:04:20,159
Found anything about
Prismatic blades in there yet?

92
00:04:20,159 --> 00:04:21,360
No.

93
00:04:21,360 --> 00:04:23,396
There should be an index
or something,

94
00:04:23,396 --> 00:04:25,164
a table of contents.

95
00:04:25,164 --> 00:04:26,466
-[slamming]
-[groaning in frustration]

96
00:04:26,466 --> 00:04:29,269
We should be out there
looking for the Forbidden Five!

97
00:04:29,269 --> 00:04:31,237
Who knows what kind of damage
they're doing now?

98
00:04:31,237 --> 00:04:32,772
Look for them where?

99
00:04:32,772 --> 00:04:33,773
I don't know,

100
00:04:33,773 --> 00:04:34,640
but I do know

101
00:04:34,640 --> 00:04:35,875
that they aren't hiding
in this book!

102
00:04:35,875 --> 00:04:37,042
Whatever the Forbidden Five

103
00:04:37,042 --> 00:04:38,177
wanted with the sword

104
00:04:38,177 --> 00:04:39,946
is of grave importance--

105
00:04:39,946 --> 00:04:41,814
"Grave" is probably right.

106
00:04:41,814 --> 00:04:43,783
So we need to learn
more about it.

107
00:04:45,284 --> 00:04:47,787
"You're so right, Nya!

108
00:04:47,787 --> 00:04:49,988
As per usual."

109
00:04:49,988 --> 00:04:52,058
I would never say that.

110
00:04:56,562 --> 00:04:57,397
Here!

111
00:04:57,397 --> 00:04:59,065
Prismatic Steel!

112
00:04:59,065 --> 00:05:01,500
Everything's
in alphabetical order.

113
00:05:01,500 --> 00:05:03,402
[sputtering and stammering]

114
00:05:03,402 --> 00:05:05,738
Well, why didn't Roby
tell me that?

115
00:05:05,738 --> 00:05:06,772
According to this,

116
00:05:06,772 --> 00:05:08,608
if you look through
a Prismatic Blade,

117
00:05:08,608 --> 00:05:11,377
it can reveal
hidden souls around us.

118
00:05:11,377 --> 00:05:13,212
The blade was not forged
in fire,

119
00:05:13,212 --> 00:05:16,215
but the resonance
of soul energy.

120
00:05:16,215 --> 00:05:17,182
Hidden souls?

121
00:05:17,182 --> 00:05:19,218
[shuddering] Creeptastic.

122
00:05:19,218 --> 00:05:20,553
Get this--

123
00:05:20,553 --> 00:05:23,355
eons ago, there was this dragon
named ThunderFang,

124
00:05:23,355 --> 00:05:26,024
who was desperate to become
a Source Dragon.

125
00:05:26,024 --> 00:05:27,493
When all his attempts failed,

126
00:05:27,493 --> 00:05:28,961
he became enraged,

127
00:05:28,961 --> 00:05:30,329
bitter...

128
00:05:30,329 --> 00:05:33,533
and tried to destroy
everything in his path.

129
00:05:33,533 --> 00:05:35,334
The only thing
that defeated him was--

130
00:05:35,334 --> 00:05:37,970
A giant comet! Quicksand!
Heartburn...

131
00:05:37,970 --> 00:05:39,205
Stop talking.

132
00:05:39,205 --> 00:05:41,173
The only thing
that defeated ThunderFang

133
00:05:41,173 --> 00:05:43,810
was the Arc Dragon of Focus.

134
00:05:45,044 --> 00:05:46,278
ThunderFang,

135
00:05:46,278 --> 00:05:47,914
who they called
a Shatter Dragon of Chaos,

136
00:05:47,914 --> 00:05:49,215
was then imprisoned,

137
00:05:49,215 --> 00:05:50,549
with chains
that could only be cut

138
00:05:50,549 --> 00:05:52,384
by five Prismatic blades.

139
00:05:52,384 --> 00:05:53,485
[gasping]

140
00:05:53,485 --> 00:05:54,954
This must be
what the Forbidden Five

141
00:05:54,954 --> 00:05:56,388
wanted that blade for!

142
00:05:56,388 --> 00:05:58,423
To free
an ancient Dragon of Chaos

143
00:05:58,423 --> 00:06:00,492
that tried to destroy the world?

144
00:06:00,492 --> 00:06:01,760
Don't like the sound of that.

145
00:06:01,760 --> 00:06:03,563
We gotta warn the other Ninja.

146
00:06:05,131 --> 00:06:06,766
[wind gusting]

147
00:06:09,268 --> 00:06:11,738
[thunder rumbling]

148
00:06:14,172 --> 00:06:16,342
[grunting and struggling]

149
00:06:16,342 --> 00:06:18,944
You will repair this.

150
00:06:18,944 --> 00:06:20,746
I choose to grant wishes

151
00:06:20,746 --> 00:06:23,282
only to those
whose need is pure.

152
00:06:23,282 --> 00:06:25,885
If you won't help me
by choice...

153
00:06:27,319 --> 00:06:28,320
[gasping]

154
00:06:28,320 --> 00:06:29,622
[shuddering]

155
00:06:29,622 --> 00:06:33,225
Ah... you do know what this is.

156
00:06:33,225 --> 00:06:35,627
Once I trap you inside here,

157
00:06:35,627 --> 00:06:37,529
you will be my servant,

158
00:06:37,529 --> 00:06:40,899
and have no choice
but to grant my wishes.

159
00:06:40,899 --> 00:06:42,001
Never.

160
00:06:43,068 --> 00:06:44,136
[roaring]

161
00:06:44,136 --> 00:06:45,872
Get him!

162
00:06:48,975 --> 00:06:50,876
I'm still so weak...

163
00:06:50,876 --> 00:06:52,378
[panting]

164
00:06:52,378 --> 00:06:53,813
[snarling]

165
00:06:58,451 --> 00:07:00,887
[breathing hard]

166
00:07:02,788 --> 00:07:04,689
You're lucky the Ninja
aren't here.

167
00:07:04,689 --> 00:07:07,359
They would defeat you with ease.

168
00:07:07,359 --> 00:07:09,595
You're no match for my friends!

169
00:07:09,595 --> 00:07:12,898
I think you mean the Ninja
are no match for us!

170
00:07:12,898 --> 00:07:14,099
Get him!

171
00:07:14,099 --> 00:07:15,268
Really?

172
00:07:15,268 --> 00:07:18,871
The Ninja have only
saved the world...

173
00:07:18,871 --> 00:07:20,405
many times!

174
00:07:20,405 --> 00:07:22,842
You're nothing
compared to them.

175
00:07:22,842 --> 00:07:25,577
How dare you!

176
00:07:25,577 --> 00:07:27,546
I wish the Ninja were here.

177
00:07:27,546 --> 00:07:30,817
Then you would see how easily
I would crush them!

178
00:07:32,151 --> 00:07:34,987
Your wish is yours to keep.

179
00:07:38,190 --> 00:07:40,192
[gasping]

180
00:07:40,192 --> 00:07:43,763
That was weird, right?

181
00:07:45,598 --> 00:07:48,134
But how do we even
find the others?

182
00:07:48,134 --> 00:07:49,068
Maybe we can--

183
00:07:50,168 --> 00:07:51,170
Maybe we can what, Nya?

184
00:07:51,170 --> 00:07:52,238
Don't leave me hanging--

185
00:07:54,339 --> 00:07:56,642
Nya? Nya?

186
00:07:57,543 --> 00:07:58,544
[gasping] Oof.

187
00:07:58,544 --> 00:07:59,812
[Riyu whining]

188
00:08:01,013 --> 00:08:02,448
Nya?

189
00:08:02,448 --> 00:08:04,616
What's going on here?

190
00:08:04,616 --> 00:08:06,418
No clue. One minute I was--

191
00:08:06,418 --> 00:08:07,419
[Arrakore] Ninja!

192
00:08:07,419 --> 00:08:09,822
[snarling]

193
00:08:09,822 --> 00:08:11,556
A little help here, please!

194
00:08:11,556 --> 00:08:13,358
-Arrakore!
-Arrakore!

195
00:08:13,358 --> 00:08:15,828
Ninja... go!

196
00:08:22,501 --> 00:08:23,936
Whoa...! [sputtering]

197
00:08:23,936 --> 00:08:25,504
[groaning]

198
00:08:25,504 --> 00:08:26,672
Sloppy.

199
00:08:26,672 --> 00:08:28,240
Embrace your anger.

200
00:08:28,240 --> 00:08:29,608
Find your strength!

201
00:08:29,608 --> 00:08:31,043
I'm trying.

202
00:08:31,043 --> 00:08:32,578
You're failing.

203
00:08:32,578 --> 00:08:35,047
You're letting your emotions
get the best of you.

204
00:08:35,047 --> 00:08:37,917
I just found out
my parents are dead.

205
00:08:37,917 --> 00:08:40,953
And who is responsible
for their deaths?

206
00:08:42,021 --> 00:08:43,589
Master Wu.

207
00:08:44,924 --> 00:08:46,225
[roaring angrily]

208
00:08:47,793 --> 00:08:49,194
There.

209
00:08:49,194 --> 00:08:51,063
Your anger gives you strength.

210
00:08:51,063 --> 00:08:52,264
Power.

211
00:08:52,264 --> 00:08:54,833
Are you certain you can
bring my parents back?

212
00:08:54,833 --> 00:08:57,636
Yes, but it will not be easy.

213
00:08:57,636 --> 00:09:00,072
The Merge can only be undone

214
00:09:00,072 --> 00:09:03,475
with power
from all seven Source Dragons.

215
00:09:03,475 --> 00:09:04,810
And how do we get that?

216
00:09:04,810 --> 00:09:06,445
Each of the Source Dragons

217
00:09:06,445 --> 00:09:09,281
must heed the call
of their own Icons,

218
00:09:09,281 --> 00:09:11,850
which can only be used once.

219
00:09:11,850 --> 00:09:15,087
That is how I summoned
the Source Dragon of Energy,

220
00:09:15,087 --> 00:09:18,490
which Imperium helped me contain
under their city,

221
00:09:18,490 --> 00:09:21,293
never knowing my ultimate goals.

222
00:09:21,293 --> 00:09:24,797
But Imperium was not ready
to contain two dragons...

223
00:09:24,797 --> 00:09:26,465
hence I've been carrying

224
00:09:26,465 --> 00:09:28,567
the Icon of
the Source Dragon of Strength

225
00:09:28,567 --> 00:09:30,669
with me all this time,

226
00:09:30,669 --> 00:09:33,805
but we need Icons
for the other six,

227
00:09:33,805 --> 00:09:36,676
and ways to contain them.

228
00:09:37,509 --> 00:09:38,744
[roaring]

229
00:09:42,348 --> 00:09:44,684
I had planned to create
new Icons

230
00:09:44,684 --> 00:09:47,419
with the Elemental Powers
I gathered at the Tournament,

231
00:09:47,419 --> 00:09:50,956
until the Forbidden Five
betrayed me.

232
00:09:50,956 --> 00:09:55,828
Now we must find other ways
to obtain the Icons we need.

233
00:09:55,828 --> 00:09:57,630
If that will bring
my parents back,

234
00:09:57,630 --> 00:09:59,164
I'll help you.

235
00:09:59,164 --> 00:10:00,933
Whatever it takes.

236
00:10:02,735 --> 00:10:05,605
[roaring
and shouting battle cries]

237
00:10:07,873 --> 00:10:09,708
[Nya] Happy to help, but--

238
00:10:09,708 --> 00:10:11,577
[grunting with effort]

239
00:10:11,577 --> 00:10:12,677
What's the deal here?

240
00:10:12,677 --> 00:10:14,546
They wish for me to reassemble

241
00:10:14,546 --> 00:10:16,481
a shattered Prismatic blade!

242
00:10:16,481 --> 00:10:17,416
[Nya] What?

243
00:10:17,416 --> 00:10:18,717
I hope you refused!

244
00:10:18,717 --> 00:10:20,252
No, we're fighting

245
00:10:20,252 --> 00:10:23,021
because I agreed to do
everything they wanted.

246
00:10:23,021 --> 00:10:24,523
H'yah!

247
00:10:24,523 --> 00:10:25,524
[grunting with impact]

248
00:10:25,524 --> 00:10:27,626
[Sora] A Prisma-what-now blade?

249
00:10:27,626 --> 00:10:28,694
[Nya] Prismatic Steel
is a metal

250
00:10:28,694 --> 00:10:29,895
that looks like crystal.

251
00:10:29,895 --> 00:10:31,564
It's made of soul energy.

252
00:10:31,564 --> 00:10:32,698
Deeply weird.

253
00:10:32,698 --> 00:10:33,865
[Sora] No way!

254
00:10:33,865 --> 00:10:35,333
We found one of those blades

255
00:10:35,333 --> 00:10:37,003
when we were looking for Arin!

256
00:10:37,969 --> 00:10:40,072
The Forbidden Five
tried to get ours!

257
00:10:41,540 --> 00:10:42,741
You gather
five of those blades,

258
00:10:42,741 --> 00:10:45,110
and you can unlock
this big, bad news,

259
00:10:45,110 --> 00:10:47,179
world-killing
Shatter Dragon of Chaos

260
00:10:47,179 --> 00:10:48,914
named ThunderFang!

261
00:10:48,914 --> 00:10:50,482
Did I somehow not know

262
00:10:50,482 --> 00:10:52,484
you were a Prismatic Steel
super-fan?

263
00:10:52,484 --> 00:10:53,819
[grunting]

264
00:10:57,089 --> 00:10:58,924
I'm not.
I just learned all that,

265
00:10:58,924 --> 00:11:00,793
like, three minutes ago!

266
00:11:07,532 --> 00:11:08,668
[gasping]

267
00:11:09,969 --> 00:11:11,270
[grunting]

268
00:11:14,306 --> 00:11:15,840
Looks like Rox is hoping

269
00:11:15,840 --> 00:11:18,077
wish magic can fix her blade.

270
00:11:24,183 --> 00:11:25,350
Wish magic...

271
00:11:25,350 --> 00:11:26,419
[roaring]

272
00:11:27,786 --> 00:11:28,921
[grunting with effort] Hup!

273
00:11:29,955 --> 00:11:31,257
H'yah!

274
00:11:31,257 --> 00:11:33,559
Despite the circumstances,
I gotta say,

275
00:11:33,559 --> 00:11:35,661
I love what you've done
with the place.

276
00:11:35,661 --> 00:11:37,029
I've been working very hard

277
00:11:37,029 --> 00:11:39,065
to try to restore Djinjago

278
00:11:39,065 --> 00:11:40,699
wish by wish.

279
00:11:40,699 --> 00:11:42,167
Well, maybe I can
help with that.

280
00:11:42,167 --> 00:11:45,471
I wish Rox and the Dragonians
would disappear!

281
00:11:45,471 --> 00:11:46,705
[Nya] Brilliant!

282
00:11:46,705 --> 00:11:48,273
[Arrakore] Your wish is...

283
00:11:48,273 --> 00:11:50,842
too big for me to grant.

284
00:11:50,842 --> 00:11:52,545
What? But-but-but
I did the thing.

285
00:11:52,545 --> 00:11:54,080
I said "I wish."

286
00:11:54,080 --> 00:11:56,114
I'm so sorry.

287
00:11:56,114 --> 00:11:58,883
Wish magic comes from
Djinjago itself.

288
00:11:58,883 --> 00:12:01,153
Though our realm
is bigger than it once was,

289
00:12:01,153 --> 00:12:03,155
it's nowhere near
its former glory.

290
00:12:03,155 --> 00:12:04,222
Bringing you here

291
00:12:04,222 --> 00:12:06,525
took almost
all the strength I had.

292
00:12:06,525 --> 00:12:09,127
I can only do small wishes,

293
00:12:09,127 --> 00:12:10,029
maybe.

294
00:12:14,333 --> 00:12:17,303
I wish Rox's feet
were stuck to the ground!

295
00:12:20,539 --> 00:12:21,907
-[Sora] Ha!
-[Rox growling]

296
00:12:21,907 --> 00:12:24,042
I wish you could see your face!

297
00:12:24,042 --> 00:12:25,878
It's just an expression,
never mind!

298
00:12:27,279 --> 00:12:28,581
Nya! Riyu!

299
00:12:28,581 --> 00:12:31,050
Wishes work,
just keep 'em small,

300
00:12:31,050 --> 00:12:31,883
and weird,

301
00:12:31,883 --> 00:12:33,452
mostly 'cause that's fun for me.

302
00:12:35,487 --> 00:12:37,857
[Nya] I wish this guy
would be jolted by lightning!

303
00:12:39,258 --> 00:12:41,260
[wheezing]

304
00:12:41,260 --> 00:12:42,394
[laughing] Nice!

305
00:12:42,394 --> 00:12:44,363
[stone rumbling]

306
00:12:46,364 --> 00:12:49,235
[Nya] I wish he was
as light as a feather!

307
00:12:51,236 --> 00:12:52,772
[roaring]

308
00:12:53,872 --> 00:12:54,840
[excited grunting language]

309
00:12:54,840 --> 00:12:57,343
One rubber ball coming up!

310
00:12:59,144 --> 00:13:01,380
[bouncing]

311
00:13:02,581 --> 00:13:04,316
Nice one, Riyu!

312
00:13:05,985 --> 00:13:07,219
How you holding up?

313
00:13:07,219 --> 00:13:11,223
I'm a Djinn.
This is my true purpose!

314
00:13:11,223 --> 00:13:13,159
Keep wishing!

315
00:13:16,128 --> 00:13:21,100
[Nya] I wish this Dragonian
had bones made of jelly!

316
00:13:21,100 --> 00:13:22,234
[Sora] I wish
this Dragonian's helmet

317
00:13:22,234 --> 00:13:23,502
was on backwards!

318
00:13:27,306 --> 00:13:28,574
[grunting] H'yah!

319
00:13:28,574 --> 00:13:30,810
[stone rumbling]

320
00:13:36,348 --> 00:13:37,449
[gasping wearily]

321
00:13:38,450 --> 00:13:39,985
[groaning]

322
00:13:41,186 --> 00:13:42,387
[Nya] We gotta scale back
the wishing

323
00:13:42,387 --> 00:13:44,256
and do more Ninjaing!

324
00:13:46,692 --> 00:13:47,893
[grunting]

325
00:13:49,995 --> 00:13:51,563
[roaring battle cries]

326
00:13:51,563 --> 00:13:53,199
[grunting with effort]

327
00:14:00,605 --> 00:14:02,007
There's no technology
I can use

328
00:14:02,007 --> 00:14:04,243
to channel
my Elemental Powers here!

329
00:14:04,243 --> 00:14:05,878
[Riyu grunting]

330
00:14:05,878 --> 00:14:07,412
But I do have feet.

331
00:14:07,412 --> 00:14:08,514
[grunting]

332
00:14:15,787 --> 00:14:17,689
[shouting battle cry]

333
00:14:17,689 --> 00:14:20,092
[growling]

334
00:14:23,995 --> 00:14:24,996
[chanting] Niver-maste

335
00:14:24,996 --> 00:14:28,100
fo le ana-ton go so-lox

336
00:14:28,100 --> 00:14:30,835
pezotan menoo-gala poxel...
-No!

337
00:14:30,835 --> 00:14:32,404
...guthero-vix da sempaste to!

338
00:14:32,404 --> 00:14:36,175
[Arrakore shouting] No!

339
00:14:37,409 --> 00:14:38,443
[Sora gasping]

340
00:14:38,443 --> 00:14:39,345
[grunting with impact]

341
00:14:41,246 --> 00:14:42,180
Let me out!

342
00:14:42,180 --> 00:14:44,115
I will never grant your wishes,

343
00:14:44,115 --> 00:14:46,218
no matter what you may do to me!

344
00:14:46,218 --> 00:14:48,620
[Rox] You are my prisoner.

345
00:14:48,620 --> 00:14:49,888
My servant.

346
00:14:49,888 --> 00:14:52,858
You must grant my wishes now.

347
00:14:52,858 --> 00:14:56,762
I wish
you would repair my blade!

348
00:14:56,762 --> 00:14:58,297
[gasping and struggling]

349
00:14:59,998 --> 00:15:02,134
Your wish is yours to keep.

350
00:15:11,410 --> 00:15:13,044
[Sora] You're not getting
out of here with Arrakore!

351
00:15:13,044 --> 00:15:15,013
Or that Prismatic blade!

352
00:15:15,013 --> 00:15:17,016
We know you plan
to release ThunderFang!

353
00:15:18,483 --> 00:15:21,153
And you three
are going to stop me?

354
00:15:21,153 --> 00:15:22,053
Ha!

355
00:15:22,053 --> 00:15:23,989
This isn't our first fight.

356
00:15:23,989 --> 00:15:25,457
[grunting]

357
00:15:26,725 --> 00:15:27,993
It's the first fight

358
00:15:27,993 --> 00:15:31,596
where I have the power
of a Djinn on my side.

359
00:15:31,596 --> 00:15:33,331
I wish you would freeze!

360
00:15:33,331 --> 00:15:35,133
[Nya] Really?
Is that the only trick--

361
00:15:35,133 --> 00:15:38,037
[frozen voice mumbling]

362
00:15:41,940 --> 00:15:44,375
Ha ha!

363
00:15:44,375 --> 00:15:47,679
I should just accept my victory
and leave,

364
00:15:47,679 --> 00:15:50,515
or wish now for your doom,

365
00:15:50,515 --> 00:15:52,183
but this is too good.

366
00:15:52,183 --> 00:15:53,685
I wish for the Ninja to admit

367
00:15:53,685 --> 00:15:57,022
that the Forbidden Five
are their true superiors

368
00:15:57,022 --> 00:15:58,691
in every way.

369
00:15:59,858 --> 00:16:00,959
[together, Riyu grunting]
The Forbidden Five

370
00:16:00,959 --> 00:16:04,663
are our true superiors
in every way.

371
00:16:04,663 --> 00:16:06,031
[Rox cackling]

372
00:16:06,031 --> 00:16:08,000
Too much fun.

373
00:16:08,000 --> 00:16:11,336
I wish for the Ninja
to unfreeze,

374
00:16:11,336 --> 00:16:14,606
so that they may bow down
before me.

375
00:16:20,746 --> 00:16:21,713
[Sora gasping]

376
00:16:21,713 --> 00:16:23,749
This is humiliating.

377
00:16:23,749 --> 00:16:24,916
[stone rumbling]

378
00:16:24,916 --> 00:16:26,050
[Nya] I don't love it,

379
00:16:26,050 --> 00:16:27,785
but at least even these wishes

380
00:16:27,785 --> 00:16:29,888
help restore Arrakore's realm.

381
00:16:29,888 --> 00:16:32,558
[stone rumbling]

382
00:16:33,892 --> 00:16:35,160
[Sora] A realm

383
00:16:35,160 --> 00:16:38,163
Arrakore's never going
to be able to return to.

384
00:16:39,898 --> 00:16:42,267
[mechanism whirring]

385
00:16:42,267 --> 00:16:44,803
I don't think that's
just a container.

386
00:16:44,803 --> 00:16:46,238
It's a timepiece!

387
00:16:46,238 --> 00:16:47,105
So?

388
00:16:47,105 --> 00:16:48,139
You have an appointment

389
00:16:48,139 --> 00:16:49,241
you need to keep or something?

390
00:16:49,241 --> 00:16:51,843
[Sora] No, Nya, it's tech!

391
00:16:51,843 --> 00:16:53,578
[Nya] Oh...

392
00:16:53,578 --> 00:16:55,547
this is gonna be good.

393
00:16:55,547 --> 00:16:57,782
Why didn't I think
of imprisoning you sooner,

394
00:16:57,782 --> 00:16:58,984
Arrakore?

395
00:16:58,984 --> 00:17:01,786
This is pure bliss.

396
00:17:01,786 --> 00:17:02,888
Now...

397
00:17:02,888 --> 00:17:05,924
I wish for the Ninja
to get up...

398
00:17:05,924 --> 00:17:10,062
[powering up]

399
00:17:10,062 --> 00:17:12,630
...and walk off
the edge of the--

400
00:17:12,630 --> 00:17:15,066
[rattling, power surging]

401
00:17:15,066 --> 00:17:16,067
[Rox] What?

402
00:17:16,067 --> 00:17:17,935
Impossible!

403
00:17:17,935 --> 00:17:19,804
I'm free!

404
00:17:19,804 --> 00:17:20,839
[Rox stammering] Uh...

405
00:17:20,839 --> 00:17:22,407
I wish you would--

406
00:17:22,407 --> 00:17:26,111
You have no power over me, Rox!

407
00:17:26,111 --> 00:17:27,879
[Rox] Get him!

408
00:17:27,879 --> 00:17:29,714
Get out of here, Arrakore!

409
00:17:29,714 --> 00:17:30,982
[grunting with effort]

410
00:17:30,982 --> 00:17:33,986
Don't make me wish it.

411
00:17:33,986 --> 00:17:36,155
[♪♪♪]

412
00:17:39,892 --> 00:17:41,226
[grunting] H'ah!

413
00:17:44,863 --> 00:17:46,331
[grunting with effort]

414
00:17:49,834 --> 00:17:51,437
[roaring]

415
00:17:51,437 --> 00:17:52,270
[wind whistling]

416
00:17:52,270 --> 00:17:54,005
[grunting with effort] Ha!

417
00:17:54,005 --> 00:17:55,874
Young ninja team for the win!

418
00:17:55,874 --> 00:17:58,444
[Riyu screeching in triumph]

419
00:17:58,444 --> 00:17:59,711
[♪♪♪]

420
00:18:07,018 --> 00:18:09,053
We got what we came for!

421
00:18:09,053 --> 00:18:10,922
Three of the blades are ours!

422
00:18:10,922 --> 00:18:12,324
Let us go!

423
00:18:15,126 --> 00:18:16,428
[grunting with effort]

424
00:18:19,998 --> 00:18:21,200
H'ah!

425
00:18:26,939 --> 00:18:28,206
They're gone?

426
00:18:28,206 --> 00:18:30,509
Oh, thank goodness.

427
00:18:30,509 --> 00:18:31,476
[groaning]

428
00:18:31,476 --> 00:18:34,713
Boy, you have grown,
little dragon.

429
00:18:34,713 --> 00:18:35,914
[Riyu screeching fondly]

430
00:18:35,914 --> 00:18:37,182
Are you okay?

431
00:18:37,182 --> 00:18:39,218
[groaning] I will be.

432
00:18:39,218 --> 00:18:41,119
You saved me.

433
00:18:41,119 --> 00:18:43,355
Just like I knew you would.

434
00:18:43,355 --> 00:18:44,822
Well, that battle
definitely helped you

435
00:18:44,822 --> 00:18:45,924
grow Djinjago a bit more.

436
00:18:45,924 --> 00:18:47,526
[stones rumbling]

437
00:18:49,828 --> 00:18:51,095
I would have preferred

438
00:18:51,095 --> 00:18:52,597
if we'd grown the realm

439
00:18:52,597 --> 00:18:55,867
by granting wishes for kittens
or something.

440
00:18:55,867 --> 00:18:57,102
Ooh, we still could.

441
00:18:57,102 --> 00:18:58,136
No.

442
00:18:58,136 --> 00:18:59,538
[chuckling]

443
00:18:59,538 --> 00:19:00,672
[coughing weakly]

444
00:19:00,672 --> 00:19:01,973
[groaning]

445
00:19:01,973 --> 00:19:04,842
I still have enough energy

446
00:19:04,842 --> 00:19:07,545
to grant one more wish today.

447
00:19:07,545 --> 00:19:08,913
Please.

448
00:19:08,913 --> 00:19:11,215
Anything you want, you may have.

449
00:19:11,215 --> 00:19:12,817
[whispering] Kittens...

450
00:19:12,817 --> 00:19:14,052
let's wish for kittens, come on!

451
00:19:14,052 --> 00:19:15,119
Sora, really?

452
00:19:15,119 --> 00:19:16,421
I'm kidding!

453
00:19:16,421 --> 00:19:18,290
Sort of.

454
00:19:18,290 --> 00:19:21,026
Okay, what I'd really
wish to know

455
00:19:21,026 --> 00:19:23,394
is where
our missing friends are.

456
00:19:23,394 --> 00:19:26,932
Ah, I wish I could tell you,

457
00:19:26,932 --> 00:19:29,868
but that is beyond
my spent powers.

458
00:19:29,868 --> 00:19:31,203
I'm sorry.

459
00:19:31,203 --> 00:19:33,071
You have
nothing to be sorry for.

460
00:19:33,071 --> 00:19:35,707
You've done
incredible things for us

461
00:19:35,707 --> 00:19:36,908
and your realm,

462
00:19:36,908 --> 00:19:38,210
and one day,

463
00:19:38,210 --> 00:19:41,646
you will restore Djinjago
to what it once was.

464
00:19:41,646 --> 00:19:42,881
No.

465
00:19:42,881 --> 00:19:46,518
You'll make it even better.

466
00:19:46,518 --> 00:19:49,154
But is there a chance
you could send us back

467
00:19:49,154 --> 00:19:50,155
to where you got us?

468
00:19:50,155 --> 00:19:53,258
Hmm, now, that... I can do.

469
00:19:53,258 --> 00:19:54,860
Can I say the thing?

470
00:19:54,860 --> 00:19:55,861
Do the honors.

471
00:19:57,663 --> 00:20:02,066
I wish we would all go back
to join our friends.

472
00:20:02,066 --> 00:20:05,504
Your wish is yours to keep.

473
00:20:07,738 --> 00:20:08,874
[gasping]

474
00:20:10,842 --> 00:20:12,711
[stone rumbling]

475
00:20:18,550 --> 00:20:19,484
[grunting]

476
00:20:19,484 --> 00:20:21,219
Sora!

477
00:20:21,219 --> 00:20:23,488
Where have you been--
[grunting]

478
00:20:23,488 --> 00:20:24,523
Ow.

479
00:20:25,924 --> 00:20:27,059
Ah! [grunting]

480
00:20:27,059 --> 00:20:28,393
What the heck, Nya?

481
00:20:28,393 --> 00:20:29,828
You've been hiding
this whole time

482
00:20:29,828 --> 00:20:31,462
just to prank attack me?

483
00:20:31,462 --> 00:20:33,298
Good job.
I wish I'd thought of that.

484
00:20:34,366 --> 00:20:35,467
--and then Arrakore
sent us back

485
00:20:35,467 --> 00:20:36,635
to where we came from.

486
00:20:36,635 --> 00:20:39,404
So you had another run-in
with Rox?

487
00:20:39,404 --> 00:20:41,773
Yeah, and our problem
with the Forbidden Five

488
00:20:41,773 --> 00:20:43,074
just got worse.

489
00:20:43,074 --> 00:20:44,308
Nya knows
why the Forbidden Five

490
00:20:44,308 --> 00:20:46,478
are collecting
the Prismatic blades.

491
00:20:46,478 --> 00:20:48,980
They are definitely
going to unlock ThunderFang,

492
00:20:48,980 --> 00:20:51,749
the Shatter Dragon of Chaos.

493
00:20:51,749 --> 00:20:53,752
And they have
three of the five blades

494
00:20:53,752 --> 00:20:54,919
to do it now.

495
00:20:54,919 --> 00:20:55,887
We have one.

496
00:20:57,121 --> 00:20:59,157
So, where is the fifth blade?

497
00:20:59,157 --> 00:21:00,325
No idea.

498
00:21:01,593 --> 00:21:02,527
Sorry, Nya,

499
00:21:02,527 --> 00:21:04,162
but finding Jay
will have to wait.

500
00:21:04,162 --> 00:21:05,664
We need to hunt down
that fifth blade

501
00:21:05,664 --> 00:21:07,332
before the Forbidden Five does.

502
00:21:09,034 --> 00:21:10,369
[wind gusting]

503
00:21:11,837 --> 00:21:13,405
[♪♪♪]

504
00:21:14,539 --> 00:21:17,341
Whew!

505
00:21:17,341 --> 00:21:18,676
Where are we going now?

506
00:21:18,676 --> 00:21:20,078
You tell me.

507
00:21:20,078 --> 00:21:21,179
Huh?

508
00:21:21,179 --> 00:21:22,614
How did you and the Ninja learn

509
00:21:22,614 --> 00:21:25,183
of the Source Dragon energy
in the Dragon Cores?

510
00:21:25,183 --> 00:21:27,118
There was this place
in the World Forest.

511
00:21:27,118 --> 00:21:29,021
The Temple of the Dragon Cores.

512
00:21:29,021 --> 00:21:31,056
Can you show me
how to get there?

513
00:21:31,056 --> 00:21:32,724
Yes.

514
00:21:46,204 --> 00:21:47,939
[♪♪♪]

